              "kind": "EXACT_SCENARIO",
              "value": "A clinic confidentiality policy tells Mara not to disclose a patient's medical record without consent. The patient is unconscious. An on-call physician needs the allergy information to choose treatment safely. Sharing the allergy entry only with that physician may prevent a dangerous reaction, but success is not guaranteed. The stated policy contains no emergency exception. Mara proposes sharing only the relevant entry to obtain treatment, rather than publishing the record. Should she share it?"
            }
          ],
